@startuml
[*] --> Draft
Draft --> Draft : evidence supplied / revised
Draft --> Limited : approveLimited [labs eligible; no open actions; independent reviewer]
Limited --> Expanded : approveExpansion [labs + field eligible; no open actions]
Limited --> Reopened : evidence / build change or concern
Expanded --> Reopened : evidence / build change or concern
Reopened --> Reopened : improved data / action closure
Reopened --> Limited : new limited decision [labs eligible; no open actions]
Reopened --> Expanded : separate expansion decision [current build had limited decision; labs + field eligible; no open actions]
note right of Reopened : Every material evidence mutation invalidates approval.\nBuild revision makes old evidence stale and resets limitedEver.\nHistory is retained.
note bottom of Expanded : Expiry / reviewer-role revocation removes effective authority\nwithout rewriting the recorded stage.\nDeployment requires isDeploymentAuthorized == true.
@enduml
